repository-code: https://github.com/turbokast/botwarren-ship
url: https://botwarren.com
abstract: >-
  The Botwarren ship agent runs on your own computer and turns what your AI coding agents are doing into a small, delayed,
  metadata-only status feed. It never reads or sends prompts, code, command output, file contents or file paths.
